    lede: "The SPU is a companion board that adds decentralized swarm coordination to your platform without replacing its flight stack. One UART to your autopilot, and your clients get fleets that share a picture, split the work and plan for themselves, and keep flying the mission when the link to the operator is gone.",
    facts: [
      ['1 UART', 'to your existing autopilot'],
      ['3 levels', 'of integration, from telemetry to vectors'],
      ['1 image', 'for the aircraft and the ground station'],
    ],
    ctaContact: 'Talk integration',
    ctaVideo: 'See it work',
    renderAlt: 'SPU companion computer — black anodized enclosure with status LEDs, SMA antenna connector, and dual JST wiring harness ports',

    clientsTag: 'WHAT YOUR CLIENTS GET',
    clientsTitle: 'A swarm option for your catalogue',
    clientsLede: 'What a client buying your aircraft with an SPU can do that they could not before.',
