      ['Fleets that survive a bad link', "Every unit plans aboard from shared state. Jam the operator link or lose an aircraft: the rest keep the mission, and the lost unit's work is taken over."],
      ['Search and ISR as a fleet', 'Grid sweeps split across the fleet, detections that become follow-up work for whoever is best placed, and steps re-checked by a second unit.'],
