    integrateTitle: 'What integration takes',
    integrateSteps: [
      ['Wire it', 'One UART to the autopilot, power from the aircraft, and any transparent serial radio for the mesh.'],
      ['Pick a level', 'Observe, waypoints or vectors: the table below says what each one needs from your autopilot and what it unlocks.'],
      ['Describe the airframe', 'Speeds, climb, sink and turn radius, provisioned once, so the SPU never asks your aircraft for what it cannot fly.'],
      ['Fly', 'Missions come from the ground station. Your autopilot keeps flying the aircraft; the SPU only tells it where to go.'],
    ],
    tiersTitle: 'What the SPU needs from your autopilot',
    tiersHead: ['Level', 'It needs', 'It unlocks'],
    tiers: [
